# Paths committed to the PRIVATE origin (Forgejo) but that must NEVER appear in the
# public GitHub mirror (lothriell/pi-k3s-cluster).
#
# The public mirror is a hand-curated, separate-history mirror (see CLAUDE.md — the
# "Catch up public mirror" workflow, which also scrubs real IPs/domains from file
# CONTENT). This file is the authoritative WHOLE-PATH strip-list for that curation,
# and is enforced by .githooks/pre-push (refuses to push these paths to a github.com
# remote). It does NOT handle content-level redaction — that stays part of the manual
# curation.
#
# Only NON-SECRET private material belongs here (planning docs / runbooks with real
# IPs & hostnames). True secrets (keys, vault, tokens, secret.yml) stay in .gitignore
# and never enter git at all — private or public.
#
# One path or glob per line. Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.

pipeline/
docs/improvement-plan.md
docs/ops-commands.md
docs/18-architecture.md
docs/13-deploy-eve-tracker-dev.md
